### [ATENÇÃO] 1. FAÇA O LOGIN PRIMEIRO PARA PEGAR O SEU TOKEN
# @name login
POST https://uc13-projeto.onrender.com/user/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "marioneres@studygo.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### -----------------------------------------------------

### [LOCAL] Criando companhia completa (Sucesso)
POST https://uc13-projeto.onrender.com/companie HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
    "name": "Teste Escola",          
    "cnpj": "46.599.464/0001-67",           
    "foundation": "1970-05-01T00:00:00.000Z",       
    "places": "RUA TESTE 123",      
    "fundaments": "Estudos Locais",    
    "methods": "Ensino Superior"         
}


