### [LOCAL] Listar todas as companhias (Rotas GET costumam ser públicas!)
GET https://uc13-projeto.onrender.com/companie/3 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

### [PRODUCAO] Listar todas as companhias
GET https://uc13-projeto.onrender.com/companie HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

### Filtrar pelo atributo nome
GET https://uc13-projeto.onrender.com/companie?name=SENAC HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

### Filtrar pelo CNPJ
GET https://uc13-projeto.onrender.com/companie?cnpj=03709814005157 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

### Filtrar por lugares (places)
GET https://uc13-projeto.onrender.com/companie?places=EPISCOPAL HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

### Mostrar uma única companhia (por ID)
GET https://uc13-projeto.onrender.com/companie/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json  

### Editar a companhia (ID de exemplo - Requer Token)
PUT https://uc13-projeto.onrender.com/companie/2 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
     "foundation": "2027-10-25", 
     "name": "EMPRESA SEM METODO"
}


### Deletar a companhia (Requer Token)
DELETE https://uc13-projeto.onrender.com/companie/2 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
